SQL Server gate:
  ISqlServerFunctions.SupportsSessionIdentity is a default interface method returning false; only
  SqlServerDialect enables it via explicit interface implementation, so the T-SQL scalar library alone
  cannot enable the identity surface (DialectCapabilityContractTests.SessionIdentity_ShouldBeOptedIntoBySqlServerOnly).
